  "description": "The target community is individuals who hold or are exposed to racist ideologies, particularly those who endorse or normalize anti-Black stereotypes, including criminal behavior associations and hypersexualization tropes. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences who may be influenced by or supportive of narratives that dehumanize Black people and justify racialized violence, especially in the context of police brutality. The visual of the police officer and the text 'i am going to shoot an unarmed black citizen' are intended to provoke and appeal to those who accept or perpetuate systemic racism and racialized violence norms.",
